---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTAButton from '../components/CTAButton.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Sam Ghanem | Fractional CMO"
  description="Sam Ghanem is a Fractional CMO, agency founder, and speaker with a career built since 2002 on brand and marketing systems for enterprise clients."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="dz-split">
        <span class="dz-split-line"><span>I Live One Big Life.</span></span>
        <span class="dz-split-line"><span>My Business Results Reflect It.</span></span>
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-inner prose">
      <p class="dz-reveal">
        Sam Ghanem's career began in 2002. She is the Founder and CMO of SG INK, a
        full-service printing, branding, and marketing agency she built into a
        21-person team serving enterprise brands including Lockheed Martin, IBM,
        Danaher, Mercedes-Benz, Carrier, and Thermo Fisher. She holds an MIBA with
        minors in Marketing and Spanish, utilizes the StoryBrand framework in her
        messaging work, and delivered a TEDx talk at TEDxApex titled
        &ldquo;It's Contagious &mdash; The Way You Treat Yourself Spreads.&rdquo;
      </p>
      <p class="dz-reveal" style="--dz-delay: 0.1s">
        Sam is mentored directly by Ken &ldquo;Spanky&rdquo; Moskowitz, founder of Ad
        Zombies, a 40-year advertising veteran behind 10 Super Bowl campaigns and
        $460B+ in client revenue generated. That mentorship shapes how she builds
        every fractional CMO engagement: bold, direct, and built on proof, not theory.
      </p>
      <p class="dz-reveal" style="--dz-delay: 0.2s">
        Her frameworks &mdash; Congruent Brands Convert, The Why Pathway, and Magnetic
        Marketing &mdash; come from one core belief: most companies don't have a
        marketing problem. They have a messaging problem. Fix the congruence between
        what you say and what you deliver, and conversion follows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-dark final-cta">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Work With Sam</h2>
      <CTAButton href="/apply" label="Apply to Work Together" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem); }
  .prose {
    max-width: 42rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .final-cta { text-align: center; }
</style>
